 newobj←CombineAllof(obj name);refobjs;refmask;refnames;refpaths

 refmask←∊obj.allOf.(0≠⎕NC'⍙⍙36⍙ref')
 refnames←(refmask/obj.allOf).⍙⍙36⍙ref
 refpaths←('.'@('/'∘=)'_'@('-'∘=))¨refnames
 refobjs←obj.##.##.##{('#.'≡2↑⍵):⍺⍎2↓⍵}¨refpaths

 ⍝ Combine properties if all refs found and there is only one object that is not a ref.
 :If (1=+⌿~refmask)∧refobjs=⍥≢refnames
     newobj←⊃obj.allOf/⍨~refmask
     newobj.required,←⊃,/refobjs.required
     newobj.properties.{⍎⍺,'←⍵'}/¨⊃,/{↓n,⍪⍵⍎¨n←⍵.⎕NL ¯9}¨refobjs.properties
 :Else
     ∘∘∘
 :EndIf
